Task: Add outbox_events table migration (ADR 0008 / TD-3.4)

Summary: Added Flyway migration V3__create_outbox_events.sql creating the
outbox_events table (id, aggregate_id, payload jsonb, trace_parent,
correlation_id, created_at). Added a failing MigrationsSuite test first
(Red), confirmed it failed against the pre-migration schema, then added
the migration (Green) and confirmed all 4 MigrationsSuite tests pass.

Files: src/main/resources/db/migration/V3__create_outbox_events.sql (new),
src/test/scala/paymentservice/MigrationsSuite.scala (new test case).

Why: ADR 0008 decided transactional outbox via Debezium CDC to close
TD-3's dual-write hazard. This table is the first prerequisite; later
tasks in this track wire PaymentStore.update and OrderReservedConsumer to
write to it instead of calling PaymentEventPublisher directly.
